atha vānyaprakāreṇa caturbhorbhistu dhyāyayet||
pūrvamabhayaṃ varadaṃ parapuṣpamitistratam|
evaṃ dhyatvā tu pīṭhasthaṃ devīpādādikeśakam||(f.19a)
upānaṃ pādukañcaiva jagati jaṅghameva ca|
kumudaṃ kukṣirityāhu bāhubhyāṃ phullameva ca||
karṇakarṇamati proktaṃ madharammarapaṭṭikā|
mahāpaṭṭi (2nd line) mukhaṃ jñeyaṃ śirovṛttiñca vārikā||
ityevaṃ lakṣaṇairyuktaṃ dhyātvā manonyaset|
budhaṃ liṅgāt ca kardaśebhāge amśañca prativinyaset||
trayaṃ śamjaghamityuktaṃ (3rd line) trayaṃśa ūrūmeva ca|
trayamśaṃ śarīramityuktaṃ galamekāṃśamīritam||
dvyamśaṃ śirovasānañca dyamśammaku(…)vinyaset|
evaṃ lakṣaṇamityuktaṃ sarvaliṅgaprakalpayet||(4th line)
vartamānasthitaṃ liṅgaṃ māsīnantu śivādhikam|
samakhaṇḍaṃ śayanañcaiva svastikaṃ liṅgapuṅgakaḥ||
ityevaṃ lakṣaṇairyuktaṃ liṅgamadhyetu dhyāyayet|(5th line)
vṛttapiṭhesthitā gauri āsinaṃ bhadrapīṭhake||
śayanaṃ padmapiṭhesyāt anyeṣu śacarācaram|
nandyāvartaṃ tu piṭhena brahmahemanibhaṃ bhavet||(6th line)
caturmukhañcaturbāhu mikṣamalākamaṇḍalum|
hastadvayaṃ tu sambandhaṃ liṅgagodhvaṃ prakalpayet||
ūdhvādhadakṣiṇaṃ vāmakrameṇa paripaṭhyate|
kūrmaśilenasamstāpya (7th line) bhūmidevi salakṣadhi||
dvibhujaṃ śvetanibhañcaiva anantopari samsthitam|
evaṃ dhyātvā menasā tataḥ sthāpanamācaret||
gandhapuṣpādibhipūjya śivāṃśenatu(8th line) mantrayet|
digbandhañca tataḥ kṛtvā padmamudrāṃ pradarśayet||
liṅgākhya pañcavaktri ca śodhani surabhimudrayā|
pradarśaye dhṛdayenaivaliṅgodhve tu viśeṣataḥ|| (f.19b)
darśayet padmamudrā ca pīṭhesarvaṃ viśeṣataḥ|
agniṃ prajvalyatat kāletatkāle homamācaret||
jayādirabhyāthanañca rāṣṭravṛddhomamācaret|(2nd line)
pūrṇāhutiñca śirasāsviṣṭa magnetimantrataḥ||
homānte tu tataḥ paścāt ācāryamūrtipaissaha|
sarvālaṅkārasamyuktaṃ piṭhañca citrapatākayoḥ||(3rd line)
dhūpadīpasamāyuktaṃ śirasādhārayet ghaṭaḥ|
śivakumbhaṃ tatodhṛtyā mūlamanteṇa deśikaḥ||
kumbhantu vardhaniñcaiva mūrtipāddhārayettataḥ|
kumbhamudhṛtya(4th line) śirasā karyādhāmapradakṣiṇam||
liṅgāgresthaṇḍilaṃ kṛtvā śālitaṇḍulasamyutam|
sthaṇḍilopari vinyasya sadāśivaṃ tu bhāvayet||(5th line)
susthāpya devabhāvena aghoreṇa nirodhanam|
puruṣeṇa tu sānnidhya īśānenatu sammukhaḥ||
dhyātvāmanonmani mantraṃ piṇḍikāyāṃ viśeṣataḥ|(6th line)
sulagne sumuhūrte tu mantranyāsaṃ samācaret||
ācārya suprasannātmā (liṅgada)liṅgaṃ dakṣiṇe sthitaḥ|
prāṇaprakuti yogaṃ tu jñātvā sthāpanamārabhet||(7th line)
prāṇomantramiti proktaṃ prakutilamitistratam|
kumbhānāṃ bījamāvāhya krameṇāvāhya yatnataḥ||
dakṣiṇenatu hastena sthāpanaṃ bindumūrdhnanī|
dhyānenaivasamāyuktaṃ sadā(8th line)(….)nyasmaran||
aṅgamaṅgaṃpratiprājñai mūlamantrāṅga samyutam|
mūdhnādipādaparyantam aṣṭatraṃśat kalānyaset||
dhyātvā sadāśivaṃ rūpaṃ kumbhotakena pūjayet|(f.20a)
vardhanyāṃ jalamāvāhya vāmepīṭhaka vinyaset|
tarjalaṃpīṭhasamsthāpya aṅganyaset budhaḥ||
vidyeśvaraghaṭāścaiva indrādin lokamarcayet|(2nd line)
pañcāvaraṇamārgeṇa arcanoktaṃ sūpūjayet||
(pañcāvaraṇamārgeṇa)
pañcavarṇaṃ pañcavaktraṃ havirdatvā viśeṣataḥ|
anyakarmāṇi sarvāṇi arcanoktaṃ (3rd line)samācaret||
ācāryaśiṣyabhaktānāṃ paricārastapūjayet||
[iti yogaje pratiṣṭhā tantre liṅgasthāpanavidhipaṭalaḥ]| śrīamṛtāmbāsameta śrīsomanādheśvarāya namaḥ(4th line)
atha ratnaliṅgasthāpanam (-)
atha vakṣye ratnaliṅgasyāt sthāpanaṃ lohajasya ca|
āṣāḍa dvayamāsañca maghamāguśīrṣakam||
apraśasthāni māsāni praśastānyāni suvṛtaḥ|(5th line)
uttamāseṣu sarveṣu śuklapakṣe śubhe dine||
śubhavārādrabhiryukte sthāpanaṃ tu samārabhet|
pratiṣṭhādivasātpūrvaṃ navame (6th line) saptame'thavā||
pañcame vāṅkurān sarvān pūrvokta vidhināssaha|
śuddhadeśe śubhe ramye devāgāre grahe'pi vā||
śalyaṃ vimocayet tatra maṇṭapaṃ pūrvavat kṛtaḥ|(7th line)
ratnanyāsākṣimokṣañca jalādhivāsamevaca||
arcanokta krameṇaiva ratnaliṅgaṃ supūjayet|
liṅgasyaiva tribhāgaikam evaṃ vā pīṭhavaindhanamevasyāt (f.20b)
sarvalakṣaṇa samyutam [iti yogaje pratiṣṭhātantre ratnaliṅgasthāpanavidhi(2nd line) paṭalaḥ]||
śrīamṛtāmbāsameta śrīsomanādheśvarāya namaḥ
pratimālakṣaṇaṃ (-)
atha vakṣye viśeṣeṇa pratimālakṣaṇaṃ śruṇu|
sakalaniṣkalaṃ verantanmātamayunocyate||(3rd line)
dhāmagarbhagrahaṃ stambhāt adhiṣṭhānadvāradevikam|
uttamaṃ madhyamañcaiva adhamantu navāmśakam||
ekaikamaṣṭadhā kratyā navadhā pratimodayam|(4th line)
liṅgamānastrayastriṃśada daśamāyāmavistratāḥ||
nāhamānaṃ tathā kuryāt guṇavonṛṣiṃna vā|
ekādaśaṃ tu pañcaite vistārāyamanāhakam||
trayastramśati bhedamsyāt (5th line) ūdhvādha kramayogataḥ|
liṅgamānenamānaṃ syāt anyeṣāṃ tu alābhakam||
hastamānamahamvakṣye ekādi navaratnakam|
mānalāgena (6th line)kartavya maṅguletvadhunocyate||
pañcaratnāni kotsedhaṃ śatāntādyādi sambhavam|
mūlaberapramāṇeva caturvimśatyadhikaṃ bhavet||
mūlaberāṅgulirmānaṃ (7th line) tanmānaṃ mānaniśvayam|
yajamānaṃ dakṣiṇehaste madhyamāṅgulimadhyamam||
parvadaivyaṃ tadāyāvaṃ mātrāṅgulena kārayet|
grahāccapratimettuṅga madhyasthānenakārayet||(8th line)
triṣvaṅguli pramāṇeṣu jātyaṃ śakaṃ narodhat|
anyamāne tathā kuryāt jātyaṃ śakaṃ tu ropayet||
vedādhikamaśitiścaṣaṣṭyuttara dvibhāgakam|(f.21a)
(…)śatibhāgañca ṣoḍaśaṃ tu vibhāgakam|| 
bhāgaikaṃ ropyayatnena brāhmaṇādi krameṇa tu|
evaṃ jñātyamśakaṃ proktaṃ tanmānaṣvādhanaśvayam||(2nd line)
śubhamānannayuktañce āyādyaṃ śamsuropayet|
trimśatādiśatāntaṃ yatpramāṇāhaṃ tu bhājayet||
ekaikaṃ bandhayet tatra(3rd line) śubhāyādini sambhavam|
āyādyaṃ śakamurdiṣṭaṃ tatbhāge ṣaṭkaniścayet||
berayāmaṃ tu niścitya sundayāmanirguṇaiḥ|
ādityadaśamaṣṭābhaṃ(4th line) hṛdayettu yathā kramam||
śeṣāmāyavyayeyo nirādhādhikyaśubhaṃ mṛtam|
vyayādhikaṃ dhānyahinaṃ samammadhyama mucyate||
yonitrayṛkṣehebhaṃ (5th line)śubhadaṇḍapadāṃ padam|
dhīmaśnākharakākānāṃ śubhaṃ sampanna nāśanam||
pūrvamānaṃ punagrāhya maṣṭābhirvittibhirviduḥ|
saptavimśat bhajeśca ṣamaśvādipaṃ (6th line) sagasyate||
yugmaṃ sarvasukhaṃ proktaṃ ayugmaṃ janavamsukham|
gaṇatvasuramānyaṣyaṃ varjayettu viśeṣataḥ||
aṣṭarāṇi nibhañcaiva (7th line) candrāṣṭamañcavarjayet|
vaināśīka vināśaṃ syāt yajamānvidi samyutam||
rājajanmānu kūlaṃ yatrājarāṣṭra sukhambhavet|(f.21b)
caturbhi(,,,)ṇitenandahṛde taskarādyaṃśamkam|| 
taskaro bhukti śaktiśca dhanyenarapatikṣipaḥ|
abhāvañca daridrañca samiddhākhyannavāṃ śakam||(2nd line)
teṣu sarvadaridrañca taskarañcaiva varjayet|
utsedhanandaguṇitaṃ munibhirbhājayettataḥ||
ādityamukhavārasyāṃ dārasauraṃ(3rd line) vivarjayet|
[iti yogaye pratiṣṭhātantre pratimālakṣaṇa vidhi paṭalaḥ] śrīamṛtāmbāsameta śrīsomanādheśvarāya namaḥ||(4th line)
tālasaṅkhyai(-)
atha vakṣye viśeṣeṇa tālasaṅkhyā vidhīyate|
daśatālādi ekāntaṃ darśayātāla ucyate||
uttamaṃ daśatālaṃ syāt caturvimśati raṅgulam|(5th line)
savimśati śatamadhyaṃ kanyasamṣodhaśādhikam||
śatadvādaśatanmātraṃ jyeṣṭhāna navatālakaḥ|
aṣṭhadhika śataṃ madhyaṃ adhamānavatālakam||
yathā krameṇa(6th line) catunmātramekāntakam|
uttamaṃ daśatālena brahmāviṣṇu maheśvaram||
kartavyāsthena mānena bārdhamāhutaṃ kramāt|
tadhaiva madhyamādaṅgam umāla(7th line)(…)sarasvati||
brāhmimāheśvari caiva vaiṣṇavi ca varāhaki|
kaumāri caiva cāmuṇḍi īśvarā ca yavarohiṇi||
jyeṣṭhāstraṇāñca (f.22a) sarveṣāṃ kṣetrapālamtathaivaca|
kaniṣṭhādaśatālena brahmāṇḍāṃ kramamārgataḥ||
ādityaḥ skandadevendramohini nayanopi vā|(2nd line)
abhicaṇḍeśvarañcaiva yamaśvavaruṇastathā vāyu||
śvāpi kuberaśca gandharvo yakṣarākṣasam|
siddhācāraṇanāgaiśca vidyādharagaṇādhime||(3rd line)
garuḍaścaiva matyete jyeṣṭhāñca navatālake|
madhyame navatālena vidyeśāni śrutistathā||
madhyame nādhame caiva śeṣāṇāṃ parikalpayet|(4th line)
aṣṭatālena madhyāsyuḥ saptarohiṇi piśācakā||
ṣaṭtālaṃ kubjakānāntu pañcagāle gaṇāparāḥ|
vāmanañca tathaivaṃ (5th line)syāt catusthālaṃ tu bhuktakam||
kinnarāśvatritālaṃ syāt kūṣmāṇḍāśca dvitālakaḥ|
ekatālākabandhasyu revantālakramaṃ viduḥ||
pratimāyāmamālantu (6th line) tālagaṇḍena bhājayet|
tattaṃ gulamākhyātaṃ bhāgaṃ kuryāt samaṃ budhaḥ||
teṣubhāgeṣubhāgaikaṃ gulaṃ parikīrtitaḥ|(7th line) 
yavāṣṭamaṅgulaṃ proktaṃ tatpramāṇenaconayet||
kolakantukalābhāgaṃ syadvitri caturaṅgulaiḥ|
yāvakaṃ(f.22b) varṇamātraṃsyāmukhadvādaśamātrakam||
yamatālamukhañcaiva vitasthidvādaśāṅgulam|
mānaṃ pramāṇamunmānaṃ bimbamānamumānakam||
pañcamānasamāyuktaṃ (2nd line) kartavyaṃ beramuttamam|
pratiyāmānayāvartu tanmānamiti padyate||
tattiryāntagurtaṃ mānaṃ tat pramāṇamiti stratam|
tadāprakantu tanmānaṃ(3rd line) mupāmmiti kīttitam||
vedahetu balaṃ sūtralambamānamiti smṛtam|
ninmonmatakṣayaṃ yasmīnnupamānaṃ prakirtitam||
uṣṇiṣamaṅgulaṃ proktaṃ keśamānaṃ (4th line) kalābhavet|
keśāntādakāṃ sūtrāntasmāghraṇavasānakam||
ghrāṇāghrāsānu paryantaṃ bhāgamevamudīritam|
bhāgaṃ grīvāyataṃ (5th line) yasmāt grivamūlāstanāntakam||
