gulphajānugatoṣṇīṣāṃ tyaktavānyeṣu vivardhayet||(6th line)
śeṣaṃ yemaṃ yathādvidvānu hṛnaitattraivahrāsayt|
ūrdhvakāyamayaḥkāyaṃ samantu śubhalakṣaṇam||
hīnādhikamadhoddhāyā (7th line) sarveṣāṃ śubhadaṃ bhavet|
mānameṣasamuddiṣṭaṃ pramāṇamadhunocyate||
dvādaśāmśapravistāraṃ mukhapūrvatrikīrtitau|(f.23a)
uṣṇiṣāt praṣṭhake śāntaṃ dvādaśāṅgulamīritam||
uṣṇiṣāt pūrvake śāntaṃ navamātrapraśasyate|
uṣṇīṣāt pārśake śāntaṃ ekaikaṃ tu namāṅgulam||(2nd line)
karṇayorantaraṃ pūrvaṃ vimśamātraṃ vidhiyate|
nāsāgrāt karṇaparyantaṃ dvādaśāṅgulamīritam||
karṇayoraviraṃ praṣṭhe sārdhadvādaśamātrakam|(3rd line)
kolakarṇantu visthāramayāmadviguṇaṃ bhavet||
karṇagrotrāyatantāraṃ atramardhāṅgulaṃ(…)|
dvikarṇevālyavātāraṃ tattat sakarṇi (4th line) paṭṭikā||
matrādhukarṇavālisyat aṅgulaṃ karṇanālakam|
lakārākṛtikākarṇaṃ candhaṃ pīṭhañcūlipūlikā||
ardhamātrāṅgulaṃ (5th line) vyāsāvarddhamātrāghanānvitam|
bhāgālambitatocūrvāparanāla prakīrtitau||
apāṅgāt karṇamūlaṃ tat saptamātraṃ prakīrtitam|(6th line)
svadhamāṃ kolakannetrāyavaṃ ṣaḍavavismṛtam||
madhyepañcamayantāraṃ jyotiryāca pramāṇataḥ|
