bhrūcakrādrūdhvake śāntaṃ tattat sampradhiviyate||
bhrūdirghasāṅgulaṃ bhāgaṃ vistāraṃ tu yamiritam|(2nd line)
dviyavārdhaṃ yavasyātha mūrdhvādhodharvavai pulaṃ||
dvigantaraṃ vimātraṃsyāt bhrūsatissāṅgamaṅgulam|
dvimātragojimūlāttu nāsikāyāṃ samunnati||(3rd line)
puṭayoḥ puṣpavannīryāt sādhavākolakaṃ tathā|
pañcamāṅgulavistāraṃ puṅgaṃ pañcayavoścriyam||
puṣkarasyaviśāloccaṃ (4th line) yavaṣadhyavamucyate|
pumsayāsūnnatavyāsamātramevaṃ prakīrtitam||
tilapuṣpasamākāraṃ nāsāgraṃ yavalaṇḍitam|
mātroccaṃ (5th line) nāsikāmūlasthāpanīyattaducyat||
puṭādadhara oṣṭhāntaṃ savayaṃkolamāmatam|
yāvādhikañcaturmātraṃ mūsyattāraṃ vidhiyate||(6th line)
uttaroṣṭhasya vistāraṃ trayavampari kīrtitam|
