gojicaturyavot sedhānimna mardhayavodhvataḥ|(7th line)
sārdhadviyavakhavistāraṃ gojikāyāṃ prakīrtataḥ||
adharoṣṭhasya vistāraṃ sayavaṃ mātramucyate|
rakṣisaptaṃ yavaproktaṃ(f.24a) mūyamantradvimātrakam||
