grivavipracaturmātraṃ tato bhāgonnataṃ(5th line) kuru||
praṣṭhagrivā kṛtaśyāṅgaṃ śūlavapra vidhiyate|
vamśamākādhisaddhaiśca kakudastrinavāṅgulam||
