kanyasīyaṃ (7th line) tadevoktañca kurmātrasya ṣaḍyavaḥ|
anāmipradeśarāyaṃ tamaṅgulirādhamucyate||
[iti yogaje pratiṣṭhātante tālasaṅkhyā vidhipaṭalaḥ]| (f. 25a) śrīamṛtāmbāsameta śrīsomanādheśvarāya namaḥ||
śūlalakṣaṇaṃ(-)
athātaḥ sampravakṣyāmi śūlalakṣaṇamuttamam|
sthāpanāṃ tamahaṃ vakṣye (2nd line) sarvadeva hitāya ca||
sarvadevamayaṃ śūlaṃ hemamrajitatāmṛkaiḥ|
āyasena tathā kuryāt alābhet vidhiyate||
garbhadvāre ca haste ca (3rd line) tālenaiva tu kalpayet|
garbhasammuktasamśūlaṃ samapādaṃ tu madhyamam||
atha manmadhyamaṃ jñeyaṃ tatbhāgena ca vakṣyate|
garbhadvāra catudvāra (4th line) tribhāgamudayaṃ tu vā|| 
garbhaṃ tu bhūmasatvaṅgadvayo rantaradhāṣṭa vā|
uttamādivibhāgenaṃ trayatriyamitistratam||
uttamādi trayajveva madhyamādi (5th line) trayaṃ smṛtaḥ|
adhamādi trayammetva vayayā kūrmitistratam||
dvārot sethasamaṃ śreṣṭha randhrabhāgavihinakam|
madhyamaṃ śūlamākhyātam adhamaṃ (6th line) śūlamucyate||
pañcamāṅgavihinamsyāt adhamaṃ śūlamucyate|
ratnastu riyakaśreṣṭhaṃ  triratniṃ madhyamaṃ śubham||
dviratniśvādhamaṃ vidyādhyasta (7th line) mānamiti stratam|
lambamāne tramśadamśādi samabhāgena bhājayet||
bhāgamekaṃ samāyājya yāvattat suśvabhodayam|(f. 25b)
yaugikaṃ laukikañcaiva dvividhaṃ śūlamucyate||
nṛpavāstu yajamānadanukūlaṃ laukikamucyate|
yogitaṃ mānamātraṣu kuryādyautikamucyate||(2nd line)
āyāmabhutabhāgaikaṃ pātrāṇāṃ lāmamucyate|
nāṭikāṃ śabhajettatra ekāṃ śāpātravistaram||
saṃgṛhyapatramānaṃ tu caturaśraṃ samaṃ kuru|(3rd line)
patradvāraṃ visṛjyādhāpārśva yorubhayorapi||
vṛttākāraṃ yathā tatra dvartayedvartitakamāt|
tayorbāhyantaraṃ grāhya bhrāmaye dindukhaṇḍavat||(4th line)
 pārśvapatra dvayaṃ hyeva bhavettadvartulaṃ nayāt|
pātrokāreṇa cādvetu yā yā yānviti samyutam||
tadardhamukulī(5th line) kuryāt madhyamūlāgrataṃ kramāt|
patravistārakasyarṣabhāgaikaṃ ghanamucyate||
tārārdhenāgrake mūle cāntaraṃ vārśvapatrayoḥ|(6th line)
pātrāyāmaṃ ca navadhā mūlenaiva tu bhāgayā|| 
pādāyāmam iti proktaṃ tadardhaṃ pādavistaram|
dviguṇāmadhyapādaṃ(7th line) tu vistāraṃ pārśvapādayat||
patrāṇāṃ pādamūle tu kuryādvai maṇḍalīkṛtam|(f.26a)
vicitra patravallabhiḥ patramūlānikārayet||
tasyāyapālikā kuryāt patrāyāmardhabhāgataḥ|
tattāraṃ navadhābhajya vyomāmśaṃ (2nd line)pālikāyataḥ||
dhyaṃśena abjatasyādhaḥ koṇa aśvardhapatravat|
kravyādapālikāṃ śaiva tadardhakalpayet||(3rd line)
galipālikāyāṃ tu vistāraṃ vibhajet tu daśāmśakam|
ekāmśagala vistāraṃ utsedhaṃ tatsamaṃ bhavet||
pālikārdhaghaṭākāra (4th line) mūlerdhamasyātta dardhakam|
tasyāyaṃ karṇayāreṇa karṇaṃ kuryāt buddhimān||
pādena kumbhatāreṇa tasyāyastaṭikā (5th line) bhavet|
ghaṭavartāṭikāmānaṃ yugabhāgavivarjitā||
ekabhāgaṃ tu hikkāva pradaṇḍakaṃ tāṭikā|
yāstu vistāraṃ(6th line) caturbhāgaṃ tribhāgikam||
tarudaṇḍasu vistāraṃ tadardhaṃ lohadaṇḍakam|
daṇḍamūlaṃ tu padmamsyāt vistāraṃ pālikāsamam||(f.26b)
tadardhaṃ mānamityuktaṃ mānaṃ guṇavibhājitam|
ekāmśaṃ paṭṭikājñeya śeṣāṃśe(…)kuśeśayam||
vṛttaṃ vā caturaśraṃ vā kārayet tu(2nd line) vicakṣaṇaḥ|
hirikāsamamānena padmodhve paṭṭikāṃ kuru||
madhyapatrasya madhye tu likhedabjaṃ tu tanmukham|
evaṃ lakṣaṇamākhyātaṃ (3rd line) pratiṣṭhāṃ kārayet tataḥ||
uttarāyaṇakāle tu śuklapakṣe śubhedine|
pratiṣṭhādina pūrve tu aṅkurārpaṇa buddhimān||
nayanaṃ prokṣaṇaṃ (4th line) proktaṃ kuryāt gavyābhiṣecanam|
sarvātodyasamāyuktaṃ sarvālaṅkārasamyutam||
triśūlaṃ samalaṅkṛtya (5th line) kuryāt grāmapradakṣaṇam|
jalecaiva prapāṃ kuryāt caturgātrasamanvitam||
navavastreṇa samveṣṭya śūlamūrghnādinaṃ bhavet|(6th line)
kakarṇamātra jalenaiva prākściraścodhva vaktrakam||
śāyayitvā triśūlañca sadyena phalakopari|
dvirātraṃ vā trirātraṃ vā ekarātramadhāpi vā||(7th line)
prāsādasyāgrataṃ kuryāt pūrvamaṇṭapapañcaret|
maṇḍapaṃ tu triyābhajya vedimadhye tu kalpayet||
ratnimātrasamutsedhaṃ (f.27a) darpaṇodara sannibham|
kuṇḍāni paritaṃ kuryāt diśāsu vidiśā samvai||
diśāsu caturaśrāṇi koṇeṣvabjaṃ prakalpayet|(2nd line)
īśāna cakrayormadhye vṛttaṃ praghānakaṃ kuru||
paścime cottare vā dhāsnānaśca bhramprakalpayet|
puṇyāhaṃ vācayettatra bhūsurān(3rd line) bhojayet tataḥ||
gomayenopaliptena vāstuhomaṃ samarcayet|
paryagnikaraṇaṃ kuryāt punaḥpuṇyāhamācaret||
vaidyūdhve sthaṇḍilaṃ (4th line) kṛtvā aṣṭadroṇaiśca śālibhiḥ|
tanmadhye padmamālikhya taṇḍulaiśca tilairapi||
lājapuṣpaiśca darbhaiśca viki(…)t tu(5th line) viśeṣataḥ|
tanmadhye āsanaṃ kalpyā vyāghrakarmacakaṃ bali||
svarṇavarṇa samāyuktaṃ vastraṃ kṛtvāyathā kramam|
jalāduttirya śūlāstraṃ(6th line) snānaśca bhroparinyaset||
vastraṃ vyapohya śūlāstraṃ śūddhiṃ kṛtvāṣṭa mrajjalaiḥ|
pañcagavyena samsnāpya śuddhodairabhiṣecayet||(7th line)
hṛdayenatu samprokṣya gandhapuṣpādibhiryajet|
kautukambaddhayet paścāt madhye patre tu tantunā||(f. 27b)
svarṇasūtreṇasamyuktaṃ hṛdayamanteṇa buddhimān|
mūdhnādi pādaparyantaṃ navavastreṇaveṣṭhayet||
caṇḍeśvarasya yatbhaktiṃ caṇḍeśāyanadāpayet|(2nd line)
[iti yogaje pratiṣṭhātantre śūlalakṣaṇa vidhi paṭalaḥ]| śrīamṛtāmbāsameta śrīsomanādheśvarāya namaḥ||(3rd line)
pavitrārohaṇaṃ(-)
atha vakṣye viśeṣeṇa pavitrārohaṇaṃ kuru|
pavitraṃ nāmayat proktaṃ śudhamityabhidhiyate||
devadānavagandharvāṃ piśācā (4th line)brahmarākṣasāḥ|
sarveniṣṭigaṇāścaiva kṣetrapālādi mutgaṇāḥ||
sarveṣāṃ tu prathārthaṃ vā pavitrārohaṇaṃ kuru|(5th line)
āṣāḍe śrāvaṇe vāpi kuryāt bhādrapadepi vā||
aṣāḍe uttamaṃ proktaṃ śrāvaṇe madhyame nyaset|
bhādrapadadhamājñeyaṃ (6th line) tribhirmāse prakīrtitam||
evamāsetu kartavyaṃ śuklāṣṭamyāṃ viśeṣataḥ|
atha vātu trayodaśyāṃ tatogandhapavitrakam||
uttamaṃ (7th line) hemasūtraṃ tu madhyamaṃ raupyame ca|
athamaṃ tāmbrasūtraṃ tu kalābhe kārpāsamevā||
kuśāñcavat kalañcaiva ṛvīṇāṃ samudāyutam|(f.28a)
netrapaṭot bhavañcaiva padmasūtraṃ tu cottamam||
alābhekāpāsamityuktaṃ tantunāsidraḍaṃ kuru|
brāhmaṇakṣatriyo vaiśyā (2nd line) śūdrakañyādha sūtravit||
sūkṣmatantu tathā kuryāt romadraṣṭantu varjayet|
śuddhodakena samprokṣya kṣālayet yathāvidhim||(3rd line)
maṇṭapaṃ samalaṅkṛtya dukṛścaiva devāṅgakaiḥ|
pālikān purṇakumbhaiśca darpaṇadvivicitrayet||
aṅkurārpaṇayettatrā pūrvokta (4th line) vidhinā saha|
dvādaśaṃ ṣoḍaśaṃ caiva pañcavimśatirevavā||
pañcadaśitikañcaiva aṣṭottaraśatantu vā|
snapanadravyasahitaṃ (5th line) sthāpayedvidhi pūrvakam||
svavastrān sāpidhānañca hemaratnasamanvitam|
pūrvokta viśinācaiva kalaśasthāpanañcaret||
paśvādhomaṃ (6th line) prakalpyātha kuṇḍe vā sthaṇḍilepi vā|
samidhājyacaruṃ lājān saṣupañca yavāṃ tilān||
homadravyāṇi sarvāṇi krameṇaivatu (7th line) homayet|
samidhājya kramaiṇaiva ājyaṃ vā menahrayate||
aghoreṇa caruṃ hṛtvā lājaṃṃ tat puruṣeṇa tu|
tilamiśāna (f. 28b) mantreṇa sarṣapaṃṃ kavacena tu||
āḍakaṃṃ hṛdayañcaiva śivāyāṅgulameva ca|
kavacenamayaṃ hṛtvārāpūrvaiparastrameva ca||
akṣatairastramantreṇa (2nd line) kramāddhutvā viśeṣataḥ|
pūrṇāṃ tu mūlamantreṇa evaṃ homaṃ prakalpayet||
liṅge vā kautuke vāpi śuddhasnānena pūjayet|(3rd line)
ṣoḍaśapratimā caiva gandhapuṣpādirarcayet||
sthānamaṇṭapake vāpi pratimāmarcayet kramāt|
naivedyaṃ dāpayet paśvāt tāmbūlaṃ tu nivedayet||(4th line)
stotramaṅgalapāṭheśca vedādhyāyanaghoṣakaiḥ|
śaṅkhabheyyādighoṣaiśca jayaśabdādi maṅgalaiḥ||
geyanṛtyaṃ tu kartavyaṃ pavitramadhivāsayet|(5th line)
nityā kumbhaṃ niśākuryāt samādhikṛtayogataḥ||
pavitrādhi vāsanaṃ kṛtvā paśvāt tu vidhipūrvakam|
aṣṭottaraśataṃ kuryāt pañcāśat (6th line) pañcavimśatiḥ||
uttamaṃ madhyamaṃ caiva kanyasañca prakīrtitāḥ|
maṅgalārdhaṃ tu kartavyaṃ pañcavimśat pavitrakam||
dviyaṅgulenamāneva atha vācāṅgulena ca|(7th line)
bandhānaṃ tatra kurvīta tantunā bandhayet kramāt||
kuṅkumena pradhivyā tu añjanena haridrayagrandhi |
bandhaṃ tataḥ kṛtvā śāstradaṣṭena karmaṇā ||(f.29a)
śarīraṃ hariberañca taraṅgaṃ nāma pūṣpakam|
gandhapatraṃ tu kaccolam eṣāṃ gandhaṃ vidhiyate||
granthiṃ bandhaṃ tataḥ kuryāt sūtrasaṅkhyāt saṅkhyayā|(2nd line)
liṅganārhapramāṇaṃ yat tat pramāṇena bandhayet||
gaṅgāvātaracoṣṇīṣam evaṃ kuryāt prayattataḥ|
hemarajitapātraṃ ca tāmmrakā(…..)(3rd line)pivā||
sarvalakṣaṇasamyuktaṃ viśālatasuśobhanam|
tanmadhye nidhātavyaṃ gandhapuṣpādinārcayet||
paridhānaṃ tu kartavyaṃ navaṃ sarvatra(4th line)(...)tasyoparinyaset|
kurcaṃ sthāpayenmaṇṭape kramāt evaṃ kṛtvādhivā||
sa(…)prātaḥkāle samuddharet śaucamācamanaṃ (5th line) snānaṃ sandhyāvandanameva vā|
pūrvedyurvidhinā caiva devanyāsaṃ tu kārayet|
īśvarārohaṇaṃ sūtraṃ caṇḍeśāya nivedayet||
abhitaḥ kalaśān (6th line) kṛtvā arcayitvā viśeṣataḥ|
puṇyāhaṃ vācayitvā tu svastimaṅgalavācakaiḥ||
jayaśabdagitanṛttādyai bahmaghoṣādi samyutam|
bheritradaṅga(7th line)paṭahaikāntalaiṅkasya ṇṭakaiḥ||
dhallarī maddalaścaiva kartarī tālavamśakaiḥ|
śaṅkhadundubhi vādyeśca sarvālaṅkāraśobhitam||(f.29b)
navavastraparidhanaṃ śiroveṣṭanamācaret|
svarṇapuṣpaśiroyoktaṃ svarṇayajñaupavitinam||
sarvālaṅgakāra (2nd line) samyuktamālayaṃ tu pradakṣiṇam|
tatogarbhagrahaṃ gatvā āropayet pavitrakam||
arcayitvā viśeṣeṇa dhūpadīpa kramāt gatam|(3rd line)
nirgatañcaikataṃ gehamālayaṃ sūtraveṣṭanam|
naivedyaṃ tu pradātavyaṃ pāyasānnaṃ viśeṣataḥ||
ācāryaṃ pūjayet tatra yathāvittānusārataḥ|(4th line)
sā sādhakānāṃ tu sampūjya bhaktāśca pūjayet kramāt||
paricārakapūjaiśca brāhmaṇān bhojayet tataḥ|
bhūsurān bhojayennityaṃ(5th line) yadhāvittānusārataḥ||
āgamaṃ tu samārabhya śivadharma purāṇake|
purāṇe vaktrānu sampūjya devayajñaja pūjayet||
sarvadevān (6th line)samāropya parādhina pavitrakaiḥ|
pavitrārohaṇañcaiva paktāmśca paricārakaiḥ||
janān sarvān pradātavya karṇikān sa pavitrakān|(7th line)
dvādaśāhañca haṣṭāham pañcāhuntryaha mevavā||
pavitrārohaṇaṃ tatra sadhyakāletu pūjayet|
stāne pavitrakaṃ (f. 30a) tyajyā pūjānte tu suyojayet||
sadārohaṃ tataḥ kuryāt sarvālaṅkāra samyutam|
pūrvapavitramādāya caṇḍeśāya nivedayet||(2nd line) 
snapanaṃ tatra kurvīta gandhapuṣpādinārcayet|
paścāt tapasvinaṃ pūjya āśchādyena samācaret||
kaupīnamuttaraṃ sāṅgaṃ yogināṃ tu(3rd line) pradāpayet|
keśādivanaṃ dīkṣā samskārañca pradakṣiṇam|
sūcikarmādirātriṃ ca dineṣveteṣu varjayet||
maṇḍalaṃ varjayet (4th line) pūrvaṃ latāliṅgot bhavet tu vā|
padmamaṇḍalamevaṃ vā ardhacandramathāpi vā||
ācāryasya manobhāgaṃ pūjayete pūrvarātrake|(5th line)
maṇḍalaṃ pūjayet tatra pūjāvasanakālake||
maṇḍape tu ralaṅkṛtya sarvadravyāṇi sādhayet|
darpaṇañcāmarañcaiva tālabrandañca citrakāḥ||(6th line)
romāropaṃ tataḥ kāṣṭhā nakharomādicetanam|
vastramābharaṇaṃ pātraṃ bhasmadhāraṃ kamaṇḍalam||
maṇibandhorabandhaṃ ca mādhāraṃ kaupīna meva ca|(7th line)
ānjanena ca pātreṇa ānjanaṃ tu śalākayoḥ||
yogapaṭṭañca daktañca maunjakṛṣṇājinaṃ tu vā|
śuktipātraṃ pañcaloham (f.30b) aṣṭamaṅgalamāyudham||
kūrmāsanaṃ ca sarveṣāṃ ropayet maṇṭapaṃ kuru|
kṛṣṇaṃ mṛgaṃ ca paraśu bhikṣāpātra madhaskṛtam||
divyāyudhaṃ divyagandhaṃ (2nd line) sūrya candraṃ tu agnikam|
gaṅgā keyūramālāśca aṣṭanāgavidherapi|| 
rudramālā śiromālā prayamuṣṇīhamāyo|
lalāṭamālā karṇamālā (3rd line) karṇaṃ tu nālabandhakā||
hṛdādi lambamālā ca mādyanta mālayaṃ kuru|
japamālā bāhumālā koparaihasta mālayāvividhaiḥ||
pātramādāya (4th line)maṇḍalāgre tu vinyaset|
evameva krameṇaiva dravyaṃ praticasthāpayet||
pavitrārohaṇantaṃ yat ādinotsaṃ (5th line) prapūjayet|
evaṃ yaḥkurute martyassapuṇyāṅgati māpnuyāt||
pūrvakṛtyaṃ yathākāyyaṃ pavitrārohāṅgaśuddhayet|
devī(6th line)yuktaṃ tathā śāstraṃ śāstraṃ pavitrārohaṇam||
[iti yogaje pratiṣṭhātantre pavitrārohaṇavidhipaṭalaḥ]| namo'stu (7th line) śrīamṛtāmbāsametaśrīsomanādheśvarāya namaḥ|| 
śrīśītaleśvarīsametaśrīmanonukūleśvarakṛpākaṭākṣamastu|| (f. 31a)
maṇḍala vidhānaṃ (-)
atha vakṣye viśeṣeṇa maṇḍalākṛtirucyate|
maṇḍapañca caturbhāgamekabhāgaṃ tu vedikā||
tālamātraṃ samutsedhaṃ darpaṇodara(2nd line) sannibham|
pañcatālapramāṇena madhye maṇḍalamālikhet||
aṣṭāṣṭapadamālikhya madhye koṣṭha catuṣṭhayam|
padmapīṭhasamālikhya (3rd line) śvetaraktaṃ ca kṛṣṇakam||
pītaṃ śyāmaṃ ca sarveṣāṃ padmamālikhya buddhimān|
padmapīṭhasya bāhye tu śvetavīdhiṃ prakalpayet||
tathā raktaṃ ca (4th line) vidhiśca raktaśyāmaṃ ca kṛṣṇakam|
pītaṃ caiva tathā nyāyaṃ catudvirāṇikalpayet||
dvārārdhamārakaṃ kuryātkarṇovakarṇamucyate|(5th line)
kapolakapolakaṃ kuryāt brahmasthānāt bahirṣvahi||
trayādalena vṛktisyāt trayaṅgulam ardhacandrakam|
trayaṅgulaṃ padmamevaṃ (6th line) syāt triyaṅgulaṃ tu svastikam||
triyaṅgulaṃ tu śrīvatsaṃ pādamānacaturaśrakam|
śvetaraktaṃ tathā pītaṃ kṛṣṇaṃ śyāmaṃ tathā nyaset||(7th line)
padaṃ prativyapāritaṃ sarvatobhadramiṣyate|
śālipiṣṭena śvetaṃ ca sindūraṃ raktayānukam||
haridraṃ pītavarṇaṃ syāt kṛṣṇaṃ śyāmaṃ ca (f. 31b) pañcakam|
dagdhalilā ca kṛṣṇaṃ syāt padaṃ pratikṛtam kṛti||
sarveṣu maṇḍalaṃ likhyakramā api parītakam|
evaṃ tu sarvatobhadraṃ latāliṅgotbhavaṃ śuṇu|| (2nd line) 
aṣṭāṣṭapadaṃ kṛtvāt madhyepadma catuṣpadam|
dalāṣṭau pañcavarṇena lekhayet tu viśeṣataḥ||
padmaṃ caturavistāraṃ (3rd line) kauśikāṅgena bhojayet|
vyomena karṇikāṃ kuryāt pakṣāṃśe naiva kesaram||
śeṣaṃ tu dalamāraṃ tu karṇikāṃ kārdhamānataḥ|(4th line)
padmabāhyamśakārdhe tu śvetavarṇena vidhīkam||
vīdhisamaṃ catudvāraṃ śobhādvāraṃ samāśritam|
tatsamānekapālaṃ tu(5th line) śobhātulyopaśobhikām||
īśānādi caturdikṣu raktapiṅgalaśvetakam|
kṛṣṇacūrṇamiti proktaṃ kapālāttu viśeṣataḥ||
indrādisoma (6th line) paryantaṃ caturdikliṅgakalpitam|
saptapadaṃ liṅgakṛtvā catuṣpadaṃ bāhyapīṭhakam||
udhveti tripadaṃ liṅgaṃ puruṣādi mukhavarṇakam|
indrādi(7th line) somaparyantaṃ caturdikliṅgakalpitam||
indrādi somaparyantamaṣṭāvimśat padaṃ bhavet|
liṅgārdhakalpaye dhimān yathā saṅkhyapadaṃ bhavet||(f. 32a)
pītavarṇaṃ tathā kṛṣṇaṃ śvetanīlaṃ prakalpayet|    
koṇakoṇecaturdhyanta viparītaṃ ca pūrṇayet||
latāliṅgotbhavaṃ hyevamācāryamanasā(2nd line) kuru|
